[%
   title = "Add-on Approval Queue"
   roles = "admin"
   PageVersion = 'admin/site_modules/approval_queue.tt v1.0 2026/10/26 CSC enables named sites only'
%]
[% IF c.session.debug_mode == 1 %][% PageVersion %][% END %]

<style>
.sm-header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:20px; padding-bottom:10px; border-bottom:2px solid var(--primary-color); }
.sm-header h1 { margin:0; font-size:1.4em; }
.sm-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:0.9em; }
.sm-table th { background:var(--bg-secondary); padding:8px 12px; text-align:left; border-bottom:2px solid var(--border-color); }
.sm-table td { padding:8px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color); vertical-align:middle; }
.tab-bar { display:flex; gap:8px; margin-bottom:16px; }
.tab-bar a { padding:6px 16px; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; background:var(--bg-secondary); color:var(--text-color); border:1px solid var(--border-color); font-size:0.9em; }
.tab-bar a.active { background:var(--primary-color); color:#fff; border-color:var(--primary-color); }
.btn-sm { padding:3px 10px; font-size:0.82em; border:none; border-radius:3px; cursor:pointer; }
.btn-primary { background:var(--primary-color); color:#fff; }
</style>

<div class="container">
<div class="sm-header">
    <h1>Add-on Approval Queue</h1>
    <span>CSC only. Subscribe is a request. Approve names the target site.</span>
</div>

<div class="tab-bar">
    <a href="[% c.uri_for('/admin/site_modules') %]">Site Modules</a>
    <a href="[% c.uri_for('/admin/site_modules/approval_queue') %]" class="active">Approval Queue</a>
    <a href="[% c.uri_for('/admin/site_modules/user_overrides') %]">User Overrides</a>
</div>

[% IF error_msg %]<div class="error">[% error_msg | html %]</div>[% END %]
[% IF c.flash.error_msg %]<div class="error">[% c.flash.error_msg | html %]</div>[% END %]
[% IF c.flash.success_msg %]<div class="success">[% c.flash.success_msg | html %]</div>[% END %]

<p>A row appears when <code>requested_addons</code> lists a module and that site's <code>site_modules</code> row is missing or not enabled. Prices are not set here.</p>

[% IF pending.size %]
<table class="sm-table">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Site</th>
            <th>Feature</th>
            <th>Subscriber</th>
            <th>When</th>
            <th></th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        [% FOREACH row IN pending %]
        <tr>
            <td>[% row.sitename | html %]</td>
            <td>[% row.feature | html %] <code>[% row.module_name | html %]</code></td>
            <td>[% row.subscriber | html %]</td>
            <td>[% row.when | html %]</td>
            <td>
                <form method="post" action="[% c.uri_for('/admin/site_modules/approve_addon') %]">
                    <input type="hidden" name="sitename" value="[% row.sitename | html %]" />
                    <input type="hidden" name="module_name" value="[% row.module_name | html %]" />
                    <button type="submit" class="btn-sm btn-primary">Approve</button>
                </form>
            </td>
        </tr>
        [% END %]
    </tbody>
</table>
[% ELSE %]
<p>No pending requests for 3d, CSC, or Shanta.</p>
[% END %]
</div>
